      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "So how should we pass the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 6.65,
          "en": "from the ImagePicker and from the LocationPicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.65,
          "end": 7.963,
          "en": "back to PlaceForm?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.34,
          "end": 11.5,
          "en": "Well, just as the TextInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.5,
          "end": 13.97,
          "en": "provides us with the enteredText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.97,
          "end": 17.2,
          "en": "We could expect to have some prop on ImagePicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.2,
          "end": 19.567,
          "en": "that could be named onImageTaken.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.41,
          "end": 23.8,
          "en": "The name is up to you because it's your component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.8,
          "end": 25.59,
          "en": "but we could expect to have this kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.59,
          "end": 27.003,
          "en": "of prop on this picker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.03,
          "end": 31.089,
          "en": "For the location, we could expect to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.089,
          "end": 32.756,
          "en": "onLocationPick prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.14,
          "end": 37.743,
          "en": "Again, the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.97,
          "end": 41.74,
          "en": "Or maybe to be in line with onChangeText,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.74,
          "end": 44.437,
          "en": "we could have onTakeImage and onPickLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.73,
          "end": 48.493,
          "en": "These props could exist on these components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.86,
          "end": 52.72,
          "en": "Then we could add more handler functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.72,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "like the imageTakenHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.294,
          "end": 62.5,
          "en": "or the takeImageHandler to, again be in line",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.5,
          "end": 65.03,
          "en": "with the name I chose here for the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.03,
          "end": 69.493,
          "en": "And also add a pickLocationHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.62,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "Just as with the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 76.3,
          "en": "we could then manage some extra state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.3,
          "end": 79.80799999999999,
          "en": "We could have some state for the pickedLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.80799999999999,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "and some state for the SelectedImage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.07,
          "end": 84.82,
          "en": "So here I have the pickedLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.91,
          "end": 90.9,
          "en": "and the setPickedLocation state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.9,
          "end": 93.963,
          "en": "And I also have the selectImage and setSelect or Selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.658,
          "end": 101.443,
          "en": "So SelectedImage and setSelectedImage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.443,
          "end": 103.5,
          "en": "a state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 105.21000000000001,
          "en": "I got these two state slices now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.21000000000001,
          "end": 107.66,
          "en": "in addition to the title state slice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.66,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "And now inside of takeImageHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 113.64,
          "en": "we could expect to get the imageUri.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.64,
          "end": 118.3,
          "en": "And then set the SelectedImage equal to that imageUri.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.3,
          "end": 121.5,
          "en": "Just as we set our title equal to the enteredText,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.5,
          "end": 123.033,
          "en": "which we get in this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.28,
          "end": 125.32,
          "en": "For the location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.32,
          "end": 128.53,
          "en": "we could expect to get our location here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.53,
          "end": 132.49,
          "en": "and call setPickedLocation and set it equal to the location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.49,
          "end": 135.063,
          "en": "we are receiving as a parameter here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "And now those functions can be passed as values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 143.12,
          "en": "through these props to the ImagePicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.12,
          "end": 145.53,
          "en": "and the LocationPicker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.53,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "For the ImagePicker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 151.88,
          "en": "we wanna pass in our takeImageHandler function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.108,
          "end": 154.86,
          "en": "And for a LocationPicker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.86,
          "end": 158.433,
          "en": "we wanna pass in the pickLocationHandler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.04,
          "end": 161.64,
          "en": "And now these functions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.64,
          "end": 165.85,
          "en": "which we just added will update our state in PlaceForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.85,
          "end": 167.81,
          "en": "We can then use this state later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.81,
          "end": 169.79,
          "en": "for submitting all our data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.79,
          "end": 172.29,
          "en": "but now we must make sure that these functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.29,
          "end": 174.01,
          "en": "are called from inside the ImagePicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.01,
          "end": 175.797,
          "en": "and the LocationPicker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.87,
          "end": 179.03,
          "en": "Now, since we passed them to this pickers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.03,
          "end": 183,
          "en": "through the onTakeImage and onPickLocation props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183,
          "end": 185.73,
          "en": "we must call these props as functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.73,
          "end": 187.313,
          "en": "inside of these components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.42,
          "end": 191.11,
          "en": "So starting with the ImagePicker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.11,
          "end": 195.94,
          "en": "there we wanna call this onTakeImage prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.94,
          "end": 198.22,
          "en": "which will be that function in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.22,
          "end": 201.223,
          "en": "We wanna call that whenever a image was taken.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.41,
          "end": 205.464,
          "en": "Now we got our takeImageHandler in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.464,
          "end": 207.633,
          "en": "and there we do set our PickedImaged,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.57,
          "end": 211.57,
          "en": "here we now also wanna call onTakeImage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.57,
          "end": 215.28,
          "en": "and forward our imageUri to this function as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.28,
          "end": 219.12,
          "en": "So that we don't just manage the imageUri internally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.12,
          "end": 221.96,
          "en": "in this component for preview purposes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.96,
          "end": 225.603,
          "en": "but so that we also pass it back to the PlaceForm component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.53,
          "end": 230.37,
          "en": "Of course, in order to use onTakeImage in here like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.37,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "We must use it or accept it as a prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 237.844,
          "en": "so we must destructure it from the incoming props object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.844,
          "end": 241.339,
          "en": "And we can do something similar in the LocationPicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.339,
          "end": 244.64,
          "en": "There, I also wanna destructure some props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 244.64,
          "end": 247.96,
          "en": "and I expect to get the onPickLocation prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.96,
          "end": 251.26,
          "en": "because I'm setting it here when using the LocationPicker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.26,
          "end": 254.13,
          "en": "So we can destructure it in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.13,
          "end": 256.3,
          "en": "And now we wanna call this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 256.3,
          "end": 258.69,
          "en": "whenever a location was picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.69,
          "end": 261.16,
          "en": "Now in the end, a location is picked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.16,
          "end": 263.84,
          "en": "when we located the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 263.84,
          "end": 267.67,
          "en": "or picked a location on the map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.67,
          "end": 269.67,
          "en": "Either way, it's fair to assume",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.67,
          "end": 272.75,
          "en": "that setPickedLocation will have been called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.75,
          "end": 275.863,
          "en": "and the pickedLocation state will have been updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277,
          "end": 279.04,
          "en": "So in order to execute this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.04,
          "end": 282.55,
          "en": "with the latest state, whenever that state changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.55,
          "end": 286.013,
          "en": "we can add another effect with useEffect here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.34000000000003,
          "end": 290.43,
          "en": "Here, our dependency is pickedLocation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 290.43,
          "end": 292.29,
          "en": "therefore, we don't need to worry about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.29,
          "end": 294.74,
          "en": "this component being focused or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 294.74,
          "end": 297.18,
          "en": "Whenever the picked location state was changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.18,
          "end": 300.67,
          "en": "the component will be guaranteed to be reevaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 300.67,
          "end": 302.64,
          "en": "because that is how React works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 302.64,
          "end": 307.04,
          "en": "If a component state changes, the component is reevaluated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 307.04,
          "end": 309.78,
          "en": "So if we add the state as a dependency here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.78,
          "end": 312.04,
          "en": "this function will be reexecuted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 313.11,
          "end": 314.54,
          "en": "And in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.54,
          "end": 317.06,
          "en": "we can then call onPickLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 317.06,
          "end": 320.13,
          "en": "and forward our pickedLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.13,
          "end": 322.65,
          "en": "Now technically, since onPickLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.65,
          "end": 323.97,
          "en": "is called in this effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 323.97,
          "end": 327.27,
          "en": "onPickLocation is now also a dependency",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 327.27,
          "end": 329.01,
          "en": "which we should add here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.01,
          "end": 331.781,
          "en": "And to avoid unnecessary reevaluations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 331.781,
          "end": 335.86,
          "en": "of this component function or even an infinite loop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 335.86,
          "end": 337.73,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.73,
          "end": 340.988,
          "en": "that is received on this onPickLocation prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 340.988,
          "end": 343.54,
          "en": "doesn't change unnecessarily,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 343.54,
          "end": 345.42,
          "en": "because whenever it does change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 345.42,
          "end": 348.313,
          "en": "this effect function will be executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 349.51,
          "end": 352.68,
          "en": "Therefore, in the place where the function for this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 352.68,
          "end": 355.72,
          "en": "is defined in the PlaceForm component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 355.72,
          "end": 359.413,
          "en": "I wanna wrap this pickLocationHandler with useCallback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.64,
          "end": 365.54,
          "en": "So I will change it to a constant like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 366.79,
          "end": 371.46,
          "en": "and wrap it with useCallback, which is imported from React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 371.46,
          "end": 374.32,
          "en": "so that we can set the dependencies of this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 374.32,
          "end": 375.33,
          "en": "which is an empty array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.33,
          "end": 378.86,
          "en": "because we have no external dependencies here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 378.86,
          "end": 380.75,
          "en": "Only the state updating function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 380.75,
          "end": 383.51,
          "en": "which could be added but which can also be omitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 383.51,
          "end": 386.463,
          "en": "because React guarantees that it will never change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 387.33,
          "end": 389.84,
          "en": "So therefore, now we ensure that this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 389.84,
          "end": 391.99,
          "en": "the pickLocationHandler function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 391.99,
          "end": 394.32,
          "en": "isn't recreated unnecessarily,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 394.32,
          "end": 397.05,
          "en": "and we therefore avoid running this effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 397.05,
          "end": 399.98,
          "en": "inside of LocationPicker unnecessarily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 401.04,
          "end": 402.96,
          "en": "Now with that, we should call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 402.96,
          "end": 406.53,
          "en": "onPickLocation whenever we picked a new location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 406.53,
          "end": 408.09000000000003,
          "en": "No matter if we picked it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 408.09000000000003,
          "end": 412.40999999999997,
          "en": "by basically locating the user or by picking it on a map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 412.40999999999997,
          "end": 415.75,
          "en": "Either way, onPickLocation should execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 415.75,
          "end": 419.006,
          "en": "And therefore, ultimately now, both takeImageHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
